      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The Avatar Search World Balancer is permanently on the front page because it's a daily recurring event from a large group (33,470 members) with only a few users in the instance in the same world daily at any time. I consider it effectively as spam advert for a regular group public instance now, not as any real event.\n\nThe issue is exacerbated that blocking groups does not remove the visibility of upcoming events from these groups.",
