  "created": "2026-10-05T17:14:33.122Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Almost every time I open up the website, I'm advertised somebody's birthday party, or a meetup, or something hosted by a group I am not a part of, have no mutuals with, etc.\n\nIt's very weird for the first thing I see in \"your events\" to be something like a birthday party for somebody I don't know and have never met or an advertisement for a nude meetup for a group I have never interacted with.\n\nI'm in groups with upcoming events! Why am I not seeing those?",
